  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Biodiversity Framework Early Action Support (Central and Eastern Europe)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="4">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Note: Disbursement data provided is cumulative and covers disbursement made by the project Agency.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To fast-track readiness and early actions to implement the post-2020 Global Biodiversity Framework by providing financial and technical support to GEF-eligible Parties to the Convention on Biological Diversity (CBD) in their work to review and align their national targets, NBSAPs, policy frameworks, monitoring frameworks and finance with the Global Biodiversity Framework.</narrative>
  </description>
